config
+ parent-provides
  + service IRQ
  + service IO_MEM
  + service ROM
  + service PD
  + service RM
  + service CPU
  + service LOG
  + service Timer
  + service Capture

+ start imx53_platform | caps: 200 | ram: 3M | managing_system: yes
  + provides | + service Platform
  + config | + policy | label: imx53_fb -> | + device ipu
  + route
    + service IRQ    | + parent
    + service IO_MEM | + parent
    + service ROM    | + parent
    + service PD     | + parent
    + service CPU    | + parent
    + service LOG    | + parent

+ start imx53_fb | caps: 200 | ram: 6M
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + parent | label: fb.config
    + service Platform            | + child imx53_platform
    + service Timer               | + parent
    + service ROM                 | + parent
    + service PD                  | + parent
    + service CPU                 | + parent
    + service LOG                 | + parent
    + service Capture             | + parent
-
